    "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/xhtml.html#xml-fragment-serialisation-algorithm says to throw InvalidStateError. Happy to tweak those rules though if there is impl interest.\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#coercing-an-html-dom-into-an-infoset has suggestions for how to deal with that situation outside a browser.\n",
