    "created_at": "2016-06-01T09:32:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-01T09:32:06Z",
    "body": "Making more things that can't be serialized in XHTML conforming in HTML makes me sad. I do realize that serializability to XHTML is of interest to fewer people than not getting errors for consecutive dashes in comments.\n\nStill, I wish this change wasn't made and in general I wish we didn't tweak stuff like this anymore.\n",
