    "updated_at": "2016-06-12T15:18:55Z",
    "body": "https://checker.html5.org/parsetree/ can be used to view a serialization of the resulting parse tree for, e.g., any of the cases in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/1356#issuecomment-222793570.\n",
